  + [source_snapshot_uuid] is 29bd88c2-59c9-48b2-b245-a5e30a39eeac

& [Need] is dependency proven
  + all three entry carrier families exist but no pure composition proves their supplied-set relationships
  + canonical encoding cannot be defined safely before member ownership and order are stable
  + raw M2A observations would erase completed lower lineage

& [Choice] is the smallest coherent composition
  + accept only non-deserializable completed carriers
  + validate current M2A structure and supplied limits
  + close duplicates, common volume, parent closure, structural order, ordinals, entry count, and file-byte total
  + preserve every complete carrier exactly once

& [RejectedAlternatives] stay rejected
  + physical scanner lacks signed runtime and fixture authority
  + receipt and aggregate digest lack canonical encoding and double-inventory evidence
  + raw observations lose nonforgeable carrier lineage
  + path normalization would silently change declared identity
  + ordinal repair would fabricate traversal evidence

& [Honesty] dominates convenience
  + structurally parent-closed does not mean physically complete
  + common volume serial does not mean physical root membership
  + structural order does not mean Windows, Git, or traversal order
  + valid deadline syntax does not mean timely execution

& [RiskControl] is proportional
  + zero effects and no new dependency
  + hard caps and checked arithmetic
  + closed output and faults
  + comprehensive adversarial tests and recursive evidence

& [Decision] is authorize only one pure implementation after satisfaction signature
